Subject: [PATCH] 0186: shop specialties back in the regional shops -- keep
 StoreName on all 81 kingdom rows (each kingdom NPC sells its own specialties
 again, no longer empty), strip ClearWorld/MoonNum (unlocked), Price 0 on all
 147 rows (free). 147 rows, no rows added. The 66 common rows stay at the
 common-goods NPC. A row can only belong to one NPC, so all 81 cannot appear
 at every single shop at once via data; all 81 are buyable across the regional
 shops.

